rows.en:
How do I know all this, you ask?
Heh heh heh... I wonder.
What does it matter?{p}

Yaguchi couldn't make up her mind.
So she decided to wait and see for a while.
The phone kept on ringing.{p}

That's right, she hung up the phone.
But she shouldn't have done that.
Because it made something terrible happen.{p}

There was a sickening thunk.
The sound of Iwashita's head hitting the corner of a desk.
I rushed over to her where she had fallen.{p}

"You humiliated me... I won't forgive you.
I'm going to put a curse on you...!"
A violent wave of dizziness hit me.{p}

Iwashita smirked.
"You've got less backbone than I thought.
You're someone I actually fell for, so I wanted you to hold out a little longer."{p}

"Did you think you could escape?
It's no use... I will never, ever let you go."
A violent wave of dizziness hit me.{p}
